		<test:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This test exhibits the effect of the comprehension principles in OWL Full.  The conclusion ontology only contains a class declaration, ObjectUnionOf class expression does not appear in an axiom.</test:description>
