		<test:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An &lt;code&gt;owl:cardinality&lt;/code&gt; constraint is simply shorthand for a pair of &lt;code&gt;owl:minCardinality&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;owl:maxCardinality&lt;/code&gt; constraints.</test:description>
